        "returnType": "void",
        "description": "Sets a string parameter used for NCHAR, NVARCHAR parameter types, which should be used for strings containing Unicode characters. This function converts the given Unicode string into a storable format. Make sure you use getNString to read the data. If you use getString on a column you wrote with setNString, an exception is thrown if the string contains Unicode characters larger than 0xFFFF."
